WEBVTT

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.650
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY
MOBILE SUIT</b>

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:12.610
The furious rain, Makes my heart shake
hageshii ame ga, kokoro wo yuruwaseru

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:15.820
Like it did on that day
Ano hi no youni

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:22.910
But I just ran through, In my dream I had till yesterday
Tada hashirinuketa, kinou made no MY DREAM

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.710
...I still believe
...shinjiteiru no sa

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:34.470
I'm willing to fight, An endless defense
Owari no nai, defense demo ii yo

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:42.350
As long as you, Keep on gazing at me
Kimi ga boku wo, mitsumetsuzukete kureru nara

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:45.270
STAND UP TO THE VICTORY!

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:50.980
Turn to face all the mornings ahead, And someday
Ikutsumono asa wo mukae, Itsuka kitto

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:53.860
Try to seize them
tsukande miseru

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:56.450
STAND UP TO THE VICTORY!

00:00:56.780 --> 00:01:02.120
Even if nothing, Lies on the other side
Sono mukougawa ni, nanimonakutemo

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:06.040
It doesn't matter to me
kamawanai kara

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:14.050
...Just as long as I can embrace, Your gentle, irreplaceable smile!
Kakegae no nai, kimi no yasashii egao daite

00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:30.560
Mankind, having polluted the whole of Earth,

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:34.200
even after ushering in an era of space colonization,

00:01:34.730 --> 00:01:38.660
just as it had on Earth, repeated its history of war.

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:45.900
Some wanted to believe it was caused by their instincts...

00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:49.530
...as they tried to adapt to a new environment.

00:01:56.860 --> 00:01:59.600
You must strike the enemy when you get the chance!

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:03.900
But Üso was unable to kill fleeing enemies.

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:09.100
And while not directly related, Count Oi Nyung was executed by guillotine.

00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:14.330
Üso now sees that he's someplace he should not be.

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:19.360
CLASH! WAVE ATTACK

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:21.800
"Clash! Wave Attack".

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:22.200
CLASH! WAVE ATTACK

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:31.900
Kill him! Kill him!

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:33.960
Die!

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:37.430
Death to the rebels!

00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:43.900
Stop!

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:48.260
Stop! No! Please stop!

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:50.300
No!

00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:04.500
Did you have a bad dream?

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:18.830
Where are you going?

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:24.060
It's too early for a morning stroll.

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:29.330
I've had enough! I've had enough of killing!

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:33.300
Üso... These times aren't going to let you just finish it like that.

00:03:33.430 --> 00:03:36.160
The Zanscare Empire will send out the Yellow Jackets,

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:39.330
and next, BESPA will invade Earth in earnest.

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:41.960
You know what that means, don't you?

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:45.360
Earth, which is just starting to revive,

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:48.960
will go back to how it was in the old century, and become uninhabitable!

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:53.030
Wouldn't that make what people have done all the more sad?

00:03:53.260 --> 00:03:57.460
Don't be afraid! No matter where you run, you can't escape this!

00:03:57.700 --> 00:04:01.330
If Earth is ruined again, it will be hopeless!

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:06.430
But, saying I have to fight in that white thing isn't fair.

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:08.230
You're rationalizing it!

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:13.400
We're not asking you to kill people.

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:18.160
Üso, it's for the sake of the Earth and ourselves.

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:21.360
This girl and I have something else we need to do!

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:23.100
We're going back to Kasarelia.

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:26.630
I... I'm sorry.

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:27.800
Wait!

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:31.230
Marbet, stop him! That boy is special!

00:04:31.260 --> 00:04:33.530
Because we forced him to be!

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:39.360
Even so, that boy has an uncommon adaptability to machines.

00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:42.160
Special... Definitely.

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:45.700
We're so pathetic.

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:48.800
Dupré's getting a promotion?

00:04:48.860 --> 00:04:50.030
That's the rumor.

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:53.030
Probably because of Fuala Griffon's constant failures.

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:58.160
It's one of the old Gundams, isn't it?

00:04:58.300 --> 00:04:59.400
Damn...

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:02.200
Just hearing the name makes me feel sick.

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:03.830
Lt. Pippiniden.

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:05.630
Yes? What?

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:09.060
I'll destroy that white mobile suit.

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:12.200
I told you, capturing a League Militaire leader...

00:05:12.230 --> 00:05:14.430
...like Count Oi Nyung was enough.

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:16.800
But, seeing how quickly he went to the guillotine...

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:20.130
As may Miss Katejina Loos, as well.

00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:21.960
She's cute, isn't she?

00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:25.760
As far as that mobile suit is concerned,

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:28.560
my own troops have a score to settle with it.

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:32.900
We'll finish it. You should take some time to recover.

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:37.660
Ltjg. Cronicle, Lieutenant Dupré is calling for you.

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:42.360
Commander Fuala Griffon was wrong to use the guillotine.

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:46.930
And now Captain Tassilo Wago in Keilas Guilie has summoned her.

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:49.630
She's been ordered back into space?

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:53.260
Commander Fuala will face a military tribunal.

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:56.560
So, why don't you escort her there?

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:01.200
Gather the damaged mobile suits...

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:04.060
...and prepare to go to Arti Gibraltar.

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:05.860
To Arti Gibraltar?

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:06.860
Yes.

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:11.400
The Public Corporation's facilities there are unarmed and neutral!

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:15.430
We'll simply make a standard request at Gibraltar...

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:17.730
...that they transport our mobile suits.

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:19.630
They're bound to reject it!

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:22.330
And I intend to take advantage of that.

00:06:22.660 --> 00:06:26.130
Gibraltar, which even the old Zeon forces could never take...

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:27.730
Will be taken by force?

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:29.900
Who else but you could do this?

00:06:44.900 --> 00:06:45.830
Pardon the wait.

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:54.000
These machines are beautiful, aren't they?

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:56.230
Our target's that white one!

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:58.730
Don't go in thinking atmospheric combat will be easy!

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:00.060
Roger! Roger!

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:02.060
Cronicle, it's nothing personal.

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:19.560
It's unforgivable!

00:07:20.030 --> 00:07:23.860
Dammit, Üso, how could you leave without saying anything to us?

00:07:30.430 --> 00:07:31.660
Yellow Jackets!

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:33.900
They're headed this way.

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:35.900
Isn't there someplace to hide?

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:40.530
There should be an old ruined city up ahead.

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:53.460
Stand by there for now. I'll lure the white one out!

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:57.330
Marbet, don't overexert yourself!

00:07:57.360 --> 00:07:59.900
Then who else will fight them?

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:10.400
I'm not going to lose!

00:08:14.030 --> 00:08:15.660
Core fighter, here I go!

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:21.060
There's just one of them! I can handle this!

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:22.600
Who's piloting it?

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:25.130
Miss Marbet of course, you idiot!

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:28.360
You don't have to sound so mean about it!

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:31.730
Well Üso isn't here, is he? Don't ask dumb questions!

00:08:31.760 --> 00:08:33.400
Stop it, you two!

00:08:35.300 --> 00:08:38.200
Romero, are the Hanger and Boots ready to launch?

00:08:38.230 --> 00:08:40.000
We're prepping them now.

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:43.000
I'm ready to dock! Hurry!

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:51.100
Don't insult me!

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:53.460
That kid's not the only specialist!

00:09:01.230 --> 00:09:04.730
Lucky Üso! He picked a good time to run away!

00:09:09.100 --> 00:09:11.930
Üso, you're not going back to the Camion?

00:09:11.960 --> 00:09:12.860
You disapprove?

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:15.930
I don't, but...

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:23.360
Who's this?

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:28.160
Aunt Maria.

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:31.730
Maria Armonia, the leader of the Yellow Jackets?

00:09:32.030 --> 00:09:36.230
No. Maria is the most common name in the world.

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:38.400
I guess, but...

00:09:38.960 --> 00:09:41.830
I've seen the Zanscare queen on TV, and she...

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:44.400
Haro! Haro! Haro!

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:50.200
That's where the Camion was headed!

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:57.200
We can't launch it like this! Get us some distance!

00:09:57.230 --> 00:09:58.400
Right.

00:09:58.730 --> 00:10:02.530
Romero, release the linking arm! Then we'll launch it!

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:03.700
Roger.

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:13.100
The enemy!

00:10:14.660 --> 00:10:17.100
Just watch! I can fight, too!

00:10:24.960 --> 00:10:26.430
What are they doing?!

00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:34.960
Everyone will be killed!

00:10:35.330 --> 00:10:37.560
Miss Marbet and the old men...

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:40.230
Odelo and Warren and Suzy, too!

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:42.100
No!

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:44.630
Üso!

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:56.500
Shahkti, wait here! I'll be back soon!

00:10:56.960 --> 00:11:01.130
Üso! If you go to the Camion, you'll fight again!

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:21.930
I finally get back to Kasarelia,

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:23.830
and now I'm rushing to the Camion again.

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:26.160
I must be an idiot!

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:33.400
Count!

00:11:36.060 --> 00:11:39.860
Killing a person like that in front of all those people.

00:11:40.060 --> 00:11:43.400
The Zanscare Empire can't be allowed to do that!

00:12:01.100 --> 00:12:02.700
Marbet, do you read me?

00:12:02.730 --> 00:12:03.300
Yes!

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:06.360
We've launched the Hanger and are sending out the Boots, too!

00:12:06.560 --> 00:12:10.400
Please. I can't last long with just the core fighter's firepower.

00:12:18.530 --> 00:12:20.130
You're not docking!

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:25.330
The autopilot's activated? That's amazing.

00:12:31.700 --> 00:12:33.600
Not bad, Gundam replica!

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:42.600
Running into the forest won't save you!

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:46.230
Where are the Boots?

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:51.930
How about fighting instead of self-destructing by smashing into the trees?

00:12:51.960 --> 00:12:52.830
Here it comes!

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:04.760
Show me how good you are as a mobile suit!

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:08.330
I've got the advantage in equipment and firepower, but...

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:20.930
Don't get too trigger happy! I want to bring it back to study!

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:24.130
Roger. As compensation, right?

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:43.600
I was supposed to be its pilot, not Üso!

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:52.900
Gotcha!

00:13:58.530 --> 00:13:59.560
Üso!

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:02.760
Now I understand how amazing you are!

00:14:10.930 --> 00:14:13.600
I can't see any sign of the enemy. Why?

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:20.730
My right hand's crippled!

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:30.860
I've got you, white mobile suit!

00:14:30.900 --> 00:14:33.560
Capturing me alive? Don't insult me!

00:14:39.130 --> 00:14:41.930
What the hell?! Just the cockpit block?

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:53.500
There's more than one?!

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:04.760
I've caught up with it.

00:15:06.660 --> 00:15:08.600
What's that doing here?!

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.530
Üso! You?!

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:13.830
Miss Marbet!

00:15:26.130 --> 00:15:27.560
What the hell?

00:15:31.730 --> 00:15:35.400
What am I doing? What am I trying to accomplish?

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:36.960
Üso!

00:15:45.030 --> 00:15:46.930
Miss Marbet!

00:15:52.330 --> 00:15:57.360
What do you think you're doing?! I thought you hated being scared!

00:15:57.430 --> 00:16:00.200
I do, but this is just so scary.

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:06.730
Hiding in the forest again?

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:12.100
ls the Camion all right?

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:13.430
For now.

00:16:15.230 --> 00:16:18.930
The Top Limb Hanger is by the building forming the waterfall!

00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:20.030
Huh? Right!

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:23.160
Üso Ewin, here I go!

00:16:31.960 --> 00:16:33.360
In front, too?

00:16:34.330 --> 00:16:36.300
How many of these things are there?

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:56.700
There it is! That building!

00:17:00.560 --> 00:17:01.430
Where is it?

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:10.930
I can do this. I can do this!

00:17:25.960 --> 00:17:29.330
I'm not afraid! I won't be afraid of you!

00:17:29.700 --> 00:17:32.060
He still thinks he can take us hand-to-hand?!

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:36.530
The right arm's unusable?

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:42.300
I won't be scared of your numbers!

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:49.400
It's fast!

00:17:53.930 --> 00:17:56.100
Oh, no. Is this it?

00:17:57.100 --> 00:17:58.660
To hell with that!

00:18:13.430 --> 00:18:14.930
I'll just have to try that.

00:18:16.960 --> 00:18:19.100
I've got you, Gundam replica!

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:27.530
Fall over!

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:37.630
You're scared now, right? Right?!

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:39.430
I'll give you plenty to be scared of!

00:18:53.630 --> 00:18:54.660
Kira!

00:18:59.030 --> 00:18:59.930
Is it him?

00:19:07.100 --> 00:19:10.000
Not bad, white suit, but this is the end!

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:35.260
Excellent! I admire your tenacity in battle.

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:37.560
This machine's worth capturing intact.

00:19:37.730 --> 00:19:39.400
Prepare to tow it.

00:19:45.130 --> 00:19:47.500
Another one of these machines?!

00:19:50.260 --> 00:19:52.930
Trying to torture him to death?!

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:56.100
Just what I'd expect from you guillotining BESPA bastards!

00:19:58.000 --> 00:19:59.030
Why, you!

00:20:15.860 --> 00:20:19.630
Recover the escape capsules, then withdraw from the battlezone!

00:20:19.930 --> 00:20:22.800
We can't use our formation tactics in this battle now.

00:20:23.260 --> 00:20:25.060
There's not enough space...

00:20:25.100 --> 00:20:28.700
...on the Earth's surface to let us fight you, Gundam!

00:20:30.930 --> 00:20:32.360
I warned you.

00:20:34.930 --> 00:20:36.530
Careful, Oliver.

00:20:37.030 --> 00:20:39.760
If a kid can get out there, so can I!

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:40.800
You?

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:42.660
What?!

00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:44.130
It's working.

00:20:45.630 --> 00:20:47.130
We don't have to bring it down.

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:54.360
Üso, you okay? You're not hurt, are you?

00:20:54.930 --> 00:20:57.000
Are you pretending to sleep? Hey!

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:02.060
What?! This kid was piloting the Victory?!

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:03.360
Something wrong with that?

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:07.530
But, who'd believe that BESPA's new mobile suits...

00:21:07.560 --> 00:21:10.530
...would be beaten in a fight by a kid like this?

00:21:10.560 --> 00:21:12.430
The truth's right here in front of you!

00:21:12.530 --> 00:21:14.130
I guess, but...

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:16.500
Man...

00:21:16.660 --> 00:21:20.860
Oliver's right to be surprised. That boy's special.

00:21:21.100 --> 00:21:22.730
Possibly a Newtype.

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:24.800
How is Üso?

00:21:25.030 --> 00:21:26.300
He seems okay.

00:21:26.760 --> 00:21:30.400
I guess, no matter what, we have to keep dragging him into this.

00:21:30.630 --> 00:21:32.960
He's a chosen pilot.

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:36.360
Otherwise, he never would have gotten to us in time.

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:39.530
Once they get Üso out of the cockpit,

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:41.700
maybe we should have Oliver service it.

00:21:41.730 --> 00:21:44.460
This might not be the best time for that.

00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:49.060
Shahkti... I have to get back to Shahkti...

00:21:50.600 --> 00:21:51.600
Shahkti...

00:22:03.160 --> 00:22:04.700
You're all here.

00:22:24.060 --> 00:22:29.530
Piercing the sky, Blue lightning
sora wo tsukisasu aoi inazuma

00:22:29.530 --> 00:22:35.320
Staining the earth, With the shadow of greed
daichi o someteku, yokubou no kage

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:41.460
Once again, when the nightmare, Envelops the Earth
futatabi akumu ga, sekai wo tsutsumu toki

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:46.790
You hear voices crying out "S.O.S."
"SOS" wo sakebu koe ga kikoeru...

00:22:48.630 --> 00:22:54.130
Let proud hope fill your heart
hokoritakaki kibou wo mune ni

00:22:54.720 --> 00:23:03.100
And stand up! Say a prayer for peace!!
tachiagare! heiwa no inori komete!

00:23:04.100 --> 00:23:05.100
WINNERS FOREVER!

00:23:06.100 --> 00:23:08.980
In every age
itsuno jidai mo

00:23:08.980 --> 00:23:14.570
...People take risks for freedom
hito wa jiyuu wo kakete

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:17.000
WINNERS FOREVER!

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:21.240
The battle goes on
tatakai tsuzukeru

00:23:21.240 --> 00:23:25.920
Fighting all alone in solitude
kodoku na made ni hitori...

00:23:32.330 --> 00:23:36.000
Now, mobile suits have even come to attack Kasarelia.

00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:38.000
It must be fate.

00:23:39.100 --> 00:23:41.030
The Gundam is stolen,

00:23:41.060 --> 00:23:45.160
and Üso and the others must fight to get it back!

00:23:45.830 --> 00:23:50.000
This is farewell to our familiar homeland.

00:23:51.200 --> 00:23:53.560
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:53.600 --> 00:23:54.700
Next Episode DEPARTURE

00:23:54.700 --> 00:23:56.200
"Departure".

00:23:56.200 --> 00:23:56.230
Next Episode DEPARTURE

00:23:56.230 --> 00:23:57.530
Please watch it!

00:23:57.530 --> 00:23:59.530
Next Episode DEPARTURE
